  speakerName: Sally
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: Siak ni Sally, maysa a lokal nga abel. Aksidente a natinnagko ti
    basketko nga abel ket ita masapul a sapulek amin a materialesko nga abel. Mabalin
    kadi a kiddawek kenka a tulongandak?
  translatedText: 'I''m Sally, a local weaver. I accidentally dropped my weaving
    basket and now I need to find all my weaving materials. Can I ask you to help
    me? '
  animationTrigger: Thankful
  triggerEventName: 
  endEventName: 
